# Source hashes are part of the evidence protocol. Preserve exact bytes across
# Windows and Linux checkouts instead of applying automatic newline conversion.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Markdown uses trailing spaces for hard line breaks; upstream files retain
# their original formatting and license notices.
*.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,cr-at-eol
mra/web/vendor/** -whitespace
docs/security/upstream/** -whitespace
